<urn:atm:triage:resolution/AY13-QA-009/1>
  a triage:Resolution ;
  triage:resolvedBy "cipher" ;
  triage:resolvedAt "2026-09-07T17:26:47Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:fixCommit "c0afd678d" ;
  triage:fixBranch "feature/ay13-doctor-team-scope" ;
  triage:verifiedInRound "qa-pr1300-r3" ;
  triage:resolutionNote "quality-mgr independently confirmed via git show c0afd678d: project() now computes per_team_budget = deadline.remaining() / rosters.len() once before the loop, and append_herdr_report's per-team tokio::time::timeout uses budget.min(remaining) rather than the full undivided remaining deadline -- bounding each team's share so an earlier team cannot exhaust the whole request deadline. Confirmed against AC7 (presence probing stays bounded, no new Herdr connections, same overall request deadline) -- compliant, this only redistributes the existing deadline across teams. Personally-run cargo test -p atm-runtime green at branch head cb13ca7e38 / current PR head 8ae936a37. Closing on this evidence." .
